00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:16.656
Beach, Delaware, with his wife, Dr.

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:17.957
Jill Biden.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:19.726
The personal attorney has had said

00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:20.393
that the

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.128
Rehoboth Beach home had been searched

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:24.030
just last week

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.865
and now the couple is spending

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:27.367
this weekend here.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.034
You have searched

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:30.003
by the personal attorneys,

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:30.970
and we do expect

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.406
FBI agents to search other properties

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:34.941
connected to Joe Biden. Arlette.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:35.508
Thank you.

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:36.342
What a night

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.011
they are in Rehoboth Beach, Delaware.

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:39.912
She is traveling with the president.

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:41.681
This is an extraordinary development.

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:42.849
We have a number of experts

00:04:42.849 --> 00:04:44.917
to help us better understand

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:47.120
what this all means, including CNN senior

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.389
legal affairs correspondent Paula Reid.

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:50.623
She is on the phone.

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:52.458
And we also have national security

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.526
attorney Mark

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:54.327
