00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:56.462
former federal prosecutor Michael Zeldin

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:57.930
and arm governor,

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:58.598
professor,

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:00.700
a lecturer in law at law at George

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.468
Washington University.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:04.170
Thank you all for coming on March eight.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.071
I want to start with you.

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:06.372
You have a lot of experience

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:08.441
dealing with classified documents

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:09.175
and so forth.

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:10.209
What do you make of this

00:05:10.209 --> 00:05:11.644
latest development?

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:14.747
Six more classified documents found

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:15.848
at the president's residence

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:16.916
and how could this

00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:18.318
impact the investigation?

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:21.788
Well, it's embarrassing.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:23.523
I mean, let's put it plain and simple.

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:24.590
This has been mishandled

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.526
from from day one.

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:28.061
I'm not concerned

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:30.163
even with the discovery of additional

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.298
possibly classified documents,

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:34.467
because just because they're still marked

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:35.535
classified from

00:05:35.535 --> 00:05:36.602
however many years ago

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:37.437
doesn't mean

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:39.105
the information is still classified.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.173
We'll have to find out.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:41.574
It doesn't excuse it.

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:42.375
I don't think

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:45.678
it will impact the legal case involving

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.780
President Biden for a number of reasons,

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.482
which we can go into.

00:05:49.482 --> 00:05:51.818
But this is obviously politically

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:53.886
going to be fodder for the Republicans.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.321
And more importantly,

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:57.390
unfortunately, it could, though

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.191
it shouldn't

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:00.093
as a matter of law, impact

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:01.728
how the Justice Department deals

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:02.662
with President Trump,

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:04.597
because as you've been saying,

00:06:04.597 --> 00:06:05.631
so many people

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:07.533
