00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:12.572
The two situations

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:14.607
are completely factually distinct.

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:16.576
The bottom line, though,

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:16.943
and you're

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:17.710
absolutely right,

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.712
there are key distinctions.

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:20.780
Most of all,

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.382
